# CODEOWNERS — ADR-023 Phase 2 split (console).
#
# Mirror of the control plane's split, on this repo's surfaces:
#   * PERIPHERY (routine app work) -> @scope-creep-review (machine account;
#     satisfies require_code_owner_reviews, cannot self-approve).
#   * ESCALATION SET (CI / hooks / gate script / infra + DB config / secrets)
#     -> HUMAN Owner @dimays ONLY, so the unattended reviewer identity cannot
#     self-dispose a change to the gates or the deploy/DB surface.
#
# CODEOWNERS = LAST matching pattern wins; escalation set overrides the default.
#
# (ADR-023 Phase 2; ADR-026; docs/owner-apply-work-sweep-unpause.md; work-117.)

# --- periphery default: routine review by the machine account ---
*                                   @scope-creep-review

# --- escalation set: HUMAN-ONLY Owner review (@dimays) ---
/.github/                           @dimays
/.claude/                           @dimays
# gate scripts
/scripts/escalation-check*.sh       @dimays
/scripts/guard-*.sh                 @dimays
# infra / lock manifests
/package.json                       @dimays
/package-lock.json                  @dimays
/bun.lock                           @dimays
/bun.lockb                          @dimays
/Dockerfile                         @dimays
/.dockerignore                      @dimays
/fly.toml                           @dimays
/Procfile                           @dimays
/app.json                           @dimays
/heroku.yml                         @dimays
# DB config
/drizzle.config.ts                  @dimays
/app/db/config.ts                   @dimays
# secrets / env
/.env                               @dimays
/.env.*                             @dimays
